SCOPE NOTICE FOR VERTIRTA AIR-GAPPED OFFLINE CFD TOOLCHAIN:
This directory (`tools/cfd_offline_gpl/`) contains strictly offline OpenFOAM
case-generation and POD-RBF compression scripts licensed under GPL-3.0-or-later
to ensure full license compatibility when paired with OpenFOAM (GPL-3.0).

No file in this directory is ever included, compiled, or linked into any
Apache-2.0 VertiRTA runtime library (`core/flight_core/`, `core/rta_companion/`,
`core/airframes/`, `core/wind_acoustics/`, `core/uspace_fleet/`, `core/fleet_z3/`).
Per FSF GPLv3 Section 0 ("output from the Program is covered only if its
contents constitute a work based on the Program"), pure numeric floating-point
and quantized int16 `VRTAWND1` lookup tables emitted by offline CFD runs are
non-executable physical field data decoupled across the license boundary and
verified at CI runtime by `scripts/ci/check_zero_gpl_symbols.py`.

Full license text: https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-3.0.txt
